SUMMARY:Viola da Gamba Players Amy Domingues and Jessica Powell Eig
DESCRIPTION:What If a Day: Viol players Amy Domingues and Jessica Powell Eig explore the rich\, resonant world of the viol with a program that travels from Tobias Hume’s playful and profound Elizabethan airs to the exquisite French baroque artistry of Marin Marais. \n  \n 
URL:https://epiphanydc.org/event/viol-players-amy-dominguew-and-jessica-powell-eig/
LOCATION:The Church of the Epiphany\, 1317 G St NW\, Washington\, DC\, 20005\, United States
CATEGORIES:Epiphany Tuesday Concert Series
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://epiphanydc.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/04/5_26-Amy-Domingues-and-Jessica-Crop-scaled.jpeg
GEO:38.8986682;-77.030449
