BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sidgolds": "https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-with-joe-mcginty-8-10/2026-05-27/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sidgolds
X-SOURCE:Sid Gold's Request Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T235900
DTSTAMP:20260527T002935
CREATED:20260302T164347Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260304T160705Z
UID:10006316-1779915600-1779926340@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Joe McGinty
DESCRIPTION:How it works: \n\n\n\nCheck out the song list and make a request here!\n\n\n\nJoe McGinty was the keyboardist for the Psychedelic Furs from 1987 until 1992 and is featured on their most recent release\, “Made Of Rain”. He is also the founder and music director of Loser’s Lounge\, an NYC tribute series that has played to sold out crowds in NYC for over 25 years. He has worked with The Ramones\, Ronnie Spector\, Nada Surf and many others. He recently composed songs for Christopher Walken to sing for the film “One More Time”. \n\n\n\nInterests include pinball\, roller coasters and vinyl records. \n\n\n\nMore at joemcgintymusic.com
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-with-joe-mcginty-8-10/2026-05-27/
CATEGORIES:New York Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Joe_McGinty_0184-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sidgolds": "https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-35-2-2/2026-05-27/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sidgolds
X-SOURCE:Sid Gold's Request Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T010000
DTSTAMP:20260527T002935
CREATED:20250217T133424Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250217T133424Z
UID:10022471-1779915600-1779930000@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:"Beltin' Out Broadway!" with Jill Paige
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Jill!\nCheck out her song list!\nMake a request!\n\nIn the mood to sing your all-time favorite Broadway songs with a live accompanist?\n\nJoin Sid’s newest pianist\, Jill Parsons as she opens up her extensive musical theater songlist to you for hours of piano karaoke magic!\n\nAnd if you’re feeling more of the pop/rock/soul world for your performance\, Jill has you covered there as well! There’s something for everyone this Wednesday at Sid Gold’s DC!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-35-2-2/2026-05-27/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/JILL-PARSONS.jpg
END:VEVENT
