X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sidgolds": "https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-22-2-2-14/2026-05-28/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sidgolds
X-SOURCE:Sid Gold's Request Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260529T010000
DTSTAMP:20260527T002935
CREATED:20260317T134444Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260317T134444Z
UID:10039985-1779998400-1780016400@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Dan Neustadt
DESCRIPTION:← Back Thank you for your response. ✨\n\n\n					\n						\n							\n							\n						\n						\n						\n						\n						\n							\n								\n									\n										\n										\n									\n									\n										\n										\n									\n								\n							\n						\n						\n							\n								\n									\n									\n										\n									\n									\n									\n								\n							\n						\n					\n				\n\n\n\nName(required)\n\n \n			\n				\n					\n						\n						\n						\n					\n				\n				\n			 \n	\n\n\nEmail(required)\n\n \n			\n				\n					\n						\n						\n						\n					\n				\n				\n			 \n	\n\n\nWebsite\n\n \n			\n				\n					\n						\n						\n						\n					\n				\n				\n			 \n	\n\n\nMessage\n\n \n			\n				\n					\n						\n						\n						\n					\n				\n				\n			\n	\n	\n\n				\n					\n				\n						Submit		\n		\n		\n	 \n\n\nTip Dan!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake a request!\n\nDan Neustadt (The Hold Steady\, World/Inferno Friendship Society\, Northern Bells) is a keyboardist\, singer-songwriter\, arranger\, and former musical director (also an attorney!). Like Sid Gold’s co-founder Joe McGinty\, Dan is also an alum of the Manhattan Inn and its white baby grand\, where he played stride-piano covers of indie rock singles. Dan’s also the creator of Off The Record\, a NYC and DC concert series featuring “cover-to-cover” instrumentals of seminal rock albums performed by a rotating cast of touring sidemen. Promoted as “Dan Neustadt Plays Your Favorite Albums By Your Favorite Bands\,” a press listing once quipped\, “No\, he’s not kidding.”  Come sing your favorite songs with Dan!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-22-2-2-14/2026-05-28/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Dan-Neustadt.jpeg
END:VEVENT
