SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Joe McGinty
DESCRIPTION:Check out the song list and make a request here! And please tip!\nJoe McGinty was the keyboardist for the Psychedelic Furs from 1987 until 1992 and is featured on their most recent release\, “Made Of Rain”. He is also the founder and music director of Loser’s Lounge\, an NYC tribute series that has played to sold out crowds in NYC for over 25 years. He has worked with The Ramones\, Ronnie Spector\, Nada Surf and many others. He recently composed songs for Christopher Walken to sing for the film “One More Time”.\nMore at joemcgintymusic.com
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-16-33-48/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Joe_McGinty_0184-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
